{"title":"UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Eligibility\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Eligibility</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Format_and_Scoring\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Format and Scoring</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Past_Exams\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Past Exams</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: History\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The New Mexico Mathematics Contest began in 1966. It has gone through three name changes \nduring the course of its history and is currently known as the UNM/PNM Statewide Mathematics Contest.\nApproximately 1000 students compete in this contest annually.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Eligibility\">Eligibility</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Eligibility\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The contest is open to all students in grades 5 - 12 as well as interested students in lower grades.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Format_and_Scoring\">Format and Scoring</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Format and Scoring\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The contest has two rounds of exams designed to test mathematical potential and ingenuity as well as formal knowledge. \nRound I is administered at the students' home school. The top finalists are invited to the UNM Campus in early \nFebruary to compete in Round II.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Past_Exams\">Past Exams</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Past Exams\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This is a list of all UNM-PNM Statewide High School Math Contests in the AoPSWiki.  Users are encouraged to post additional solutions to the problems.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2013 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2013 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2014 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2015 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2016 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2016 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2017 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2017 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2018 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II (page does not exist)\">2019 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">UNM-PNM Contest website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Problems_and_Solutions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest Problems and Solutions (page does not exist)\">UNM-PNM Problems and Solutions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017180328\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.009 s